Dear Judges and Sponsors,

Thank you for being part of the inaugural Ivy Investment Competition. We=E2=
=80=99re grateful for your time and support, and we look forward to welcoming=
 you to Brown tomorrow.

ARRIVAL TOMORROW
Thursday, November 5 at 1:30 PM ET
Welcome Lunch
Petteruti Lounge, Stephen Robert =E2=80=9962 Campus Center
75 Waterman Street
Providence, RI 02912

Please find the welcome packet attached, which includes the event itinerary a=
nd key locations for November 5=E2=80=936.

We=E2=80=99ve also attached the pitch judging rubric for tomorrow in case any=
 judges would like to look it over in advance. We=E2=80=99ll have printed cop=
ies available at the competition, so there=E2=80=99s no need to bring your ow=
n.

Please feel free to reply with any questions ahead of your arrival. Thank you=
 again for helping make this event possible. We look forward to seeing you!

Best,
The IIC Team

